chip ym2608
clock 7987200
samples 8000
mem adpcm-b opn-b.bin
fidelity min
# ADPCM-B's memory paths through the upper ports: reading the image
# through register 8 (two dummy reads, then the bytes, with the end of
# sample at the end address), recording to memory (external writes) until
# the end address, and CPU-fed playback with its BRDY handshake, read
# through the extended status; FM keeps the render from being silent.
